<DocsLayout title="SDK Reference" description="Python SDK for instrumenting ML pipelines.">

<h2>Decorators</h2>

<h3>@xray.pipeline(name, version?)</h3>

<p>Marks a function as a pipeline entry point. Creates a new run for each invocation.</p>

<pre><code>@xray.pipeline("search-pipeline", version="v2.0")
def search(query: str):
    return results
</code></pre>

<h3>@xray.step(kind)</h3>

<p>Marks a function as a pipeline step. Automatically tracks input/output counts.</p>

<p>Step kinds:</p>
<ul>
  <li><code>RETRIEVE</code> - Data retrieval (vector search, database query)</li>
  <li><code>FILTER</code> - Filtering candidates</li>
  <li><code>RANK</code> - Ranking/scoring</li>
  <li><code>LLM_CALL</code> - LLM API calls</li>
  <li><code>JUDGE</code> - LLM-as-judge evaluation</li>
  <li><code>TRANSFORM</code> - Data transformation</li>
  <li><code>SELECT</code> - Selection/sampling</li>
  <li><code>TOOL_CALL</code> - External tool calls</li>
</ul>

<pre><code>@xray.step("FILTER")
def filter_by_score(items):
    return [i for i in items if i.score > 0.5]
</code></pre>

<h2>Helper Functions</h2>

<h3>xray.drop(item, reason)</h3>

<p>Record that an item was dropped and why.</p>

<pre><code>for item in items:
    if item.score < 0.3:
        xray.drop(item, "low_score")
        continue
    yield item
</code></pre>

<h3>xray.score(item, score)</h3>

<p>Record a score for an item. Builds score histograms.</p>

<pre><code>for item in items:
    score = compute_relevance(item, query)
    xray.score(item, score)
    item.score = score
</code></pre>

<h3>xray.metric(key, value)</h3>

<p>Record arbitrary metrics for the current step.</p>

<pre><code>xray.metric("model", "gpt-4")
xray.metric("tokens", 1234)
xray.metric("latency_ms", 450)
</code></pre>

<h3>xray.artifact(name, content)</h3>

<p>Store artifacts (prompts, responses, configs) for inspection.</p>

<pre><code>xray.artifact("prompt", prompt_text)
xray.artifact("response", llm_response)
xray.artifact("config", {"temperature": 0.7})
</code></pre>

<h3>xray.tag(key, value)</h3>

<p>Add searchable tags to the current run.</p>

<pre><code>xray.tag("user_id", user.id)
xray.tag("experiment", "v2-embeddings")
</code></pre>

<h2>Configuration</h2>

<h3>xray.init(**kwargs)</h3>

<p>Initialize the SDK with custom settings.</p>

<pre><code>xray.init(
    endpoint="http://localhost:8000",
    disabled=False,
    sample_rate=1.0,
    batch_size=10,
    flush_interval=1.0,
    top_k=10,
)
</code></pre>

</DocsLayout>

